# The Fantasticar: "your fourth noncreature spell each turn". Black Lotus (1), The Fantasticar (2), a Llanowar Elves (a
# creature spell: not counted), Mox Pearl (3: only the animate trigger, the stack holds the Mox and that one ability),
# Mox Sapphire (4: both abilities), Mox Jet (5: only the animate trigger; the Fantasticar is declined at the fourth, so it is
# still there for it).

[Bot1 Deck]
The Fantasticar
